      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خوّة</span></b>  [app. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">خَوَّةٌ</span>] <i>Languor:</i> occurring in a trad.,
in which it is said, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَ أَخَذَ أَبَا جَهْلٍ خوّةٌ فَلَا يَنْطِقُ</span>
[<i>And a languor seized Aboo-Jahl, so that he
spoke not</i>]. (IAth, TA.)

